OL,3,AAnthropic set for $1.3tn stock market
OL,4,Adebut despite 'catastrophic' AI warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic, the artificial intelligence
OL,7,F(AI) company behind the Claude chatbot,
OL,8,Fcould be valued at around $1.3 trillion
OL,9,F(#1 trillion) when it lists its shares
OL,10,Ffor sale on New York's Nasdaq stock
OL,11,Fexchange.
OL,13,FThe loss-making company says it will
OL,14,Foffer its shares for between $70 and
OL,15,F$78 each and will raise up to $64bn
OL,16,Fwhen it floats this month.
OL,18,FIt would value Anthropic at between
OL,19,F$1.1tn and $1.3tn which, although
OL,20,Flarge, is below the $2tn some backers
OL,21,Fof the firm predicted in summer,
OL,22,Faccording to the Financial Times.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
